# All Dockerfiles build with the repo root as context (see docker/*/Dockerfile
# and the compose build sections), so this file must live at the repo root —
# a .dockerignore inside a subdirectory is silently ignored.
#
# Keeps local build contexts small (multi-GB otherwise) and identical to CI's
# clean checkout: without the node_modules exclusion, a local build would COPY
# the host's node_modules over the freshly installed ones inside the image.
.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
venv
local
docs
.github
